    "skyPreset": "golden_alpine_meadow",
    "loreSummary": "No road reaches this ground and no village stands on it \u2014 one of three surveyed regions on Thirstwold with neither. Parties come in over the ridge carrying every drop they will drink, take ore off the blocks the scarp has already dropped and salvage off the landward edge of the sand, and go back out over the same ridge, which carries two crossings and no third."
